kazari — https://github.com/Santiago-0t/kazari
The Windows app's interface is based on kazari's iced UI (workspace layout with a
pure core crate and an iced app crate, Elm-style App/Message/update/view, the
custom iced Theme built from a palette, closure-based container styling).
windows/crates/taskline-app/src/style.rs adapts code from
crates/kazari-app/src/main.rs.

